        <headline>Severe Thunderstorm Warning issued September 24 at 8:36PM CDT until September 24 at 9:15PM CDT by NWS Midland/Odessa TX</headline>
        <description>SVRMAF

The National Weather Service in Midland has issued a

* Severe Thunderstorm Warning for...
Southwestern Brewster County in southwestern Texas...

* Until 915 PM CDT.

* At 835 PM CDT, a severe thunderstorm was located over Study Butte,
or 11 miles east of Lajitas, moving north at 20 mph.

HAZARD...60 mph wind gusts and nickel size hail.

SOURCE...Radar indicated.

IMPACT...Expect damage to roofs, siding, and trees.

* Locations impacted include...
Study Butte and Terlingua.
</description>
        <instruction>For your protection move to an interior room on the lowest floor of a
building.

Torrential rainfall is occurring with this storm, and may lead to
flash flooding. Do not drive your vehicle through flooded roadways.</instruction>
